.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Built plugin bundles (tools/plugin/build.sh). Source is tracked, output is not.
build/

# Atomix plugin SDK headers — third-party, deliberately NOT checked in.
# The headers carry "(c)Atomix Productions 2011-2018" with no license grant and
# no terms on the SDK download page, so this repo does not redistribute them.
# Fetch them yourself with `just download-sdk` (writes vendor/vdj-sdk/ and a
# SOURCE.txt recording the URL, date and digest), or by hand from
# https://www.virtualdj.com/wiki/PluginSDK8.html (VirtualDJ8_SDK_20211003.zip).
# Community example set: https://github.com/szemek/virtualdj-plugins-examples
vendor/

# Decoded controllers.dat (device definitions, factory mappings, audio presets)
# — Atomix's own XML, vendor copyright, so never committed. One subdirectory per
# archive (`18.0.9598-r2241/`, app build + archive revision); `just controllers-vendor`
# adds the installed build's. tests/controllers-manifests/<key>.json holds the
# hashes each is checked against, and the corpus tools refuse a tree that
# disagrees with its manifest. `just controllers-diff` compares two manifests.
vendor/controllers/

# Python venv created by `just bootstrap`.
.venv/

# Half-written artifacts from an interrupted `just` capture.
tests/*.json.tmp
docs/*.json.tmp
